		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Long-snouted, sentient tapir that feeds on dreams. Mortal enemies of night hags. Tend to ethereally dwell near humanoids but are elusive.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 29, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +4 (1d4 + bran drain), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Brain Drain</strong>. The target takes 1d4 INT damage. Dreamless slumber at 0 INT.</p><p></p><p><strong>Dream Beast</strong>. In place of attacks, become corporeal or incorporeal.</p><p></p><p><strong>Dream Eater</strong>. Feeds on dreams and nightmares. Target gets no benefits from resting.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
